<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\キオク\荒田駅昼.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>1 p.m., arrival at Arata Station.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A station deep in the mountains, just as I had imagined.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was no sign of people even at this point, and yet it seemed we were going still deeper into the mountains from here.<PG>
The Arata settlement is, strictly speaking, part of the Arata district, and unassigned land.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In other words, it's state-owned land that doesn't belong to any prefecture.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There are several areas that belong to no city, town or village, but this is the only one that doesn't belong to a prefecture either.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I couldn't go so far as to find out the reason for that, but the more I think about it, the stranger it is.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Sakura-san's</STYLE> condition seemed to have settled down a good deal, too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But, <STYLE ID="1">Sakura-san</STYLE>, I'm sorry, just when you're feeling better.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The lives of this mother and daughter will soon come to an <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="つい">end</STYLE> by my hand.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Do we walk to Arata, or go by car?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Well, either one is fine.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\キオク\荒田駅バギー.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
When I passed through the unstaffed ticket gate, a short, obese middle-aged man and a well-built middle-aged man were standing there.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, are you feeling all right?" </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\サクラ\サクラ.lcm" "REPEAT" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes, sorry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">." </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I see, so <STYLE ID="3">this man</STYLE> is <STYLE ID="1">Sakura-san's</STYLE> husband.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">This man</STYLE> looks just like the <STYLE ID="4">Eiichiro Niimura</STYLE> I saw in the photo.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Could they be brothers?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎頭かく.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, one of the buggies has gone and broken down... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Our guest</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> is with us, so sorry, but would you walk home?" </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\夏菜中学バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Mm-hmm, got it! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　The buggies are pretty old by now." </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
Buggies...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Do they mean we're going to the settlement by buggy?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This way I can't kill <STYLE ID="1">Sakura-san</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="5">Kana-chan</STYLE>!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Then <STYLE ID="5">Kana-chan</STYLE> took off running toward the mountain road.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And fast as a monkey, too, leaping about between the trees.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What is that? That athleticism...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Could she be using Droga or something?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Nice to meet you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">miss</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">A guest, of all things! Now that's a rare one!" </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Oh, Goto... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">no, Momoko </STYLE><STYLE ID="7" RUBY="ふじの">Fujino</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">. Thank you for having me today." </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Letting them learn the surname Goto here would be bad.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If <STYLE ID="8">Mifuyu Niimura</STYLE> were to find out...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
More importantly, I have to change my plan drastically.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm to ride to Arata on the buggy of the other man, Shirozaki-san.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That means I can't kill <STYLE ID="1">Sakura-san</STYLE>.<PG>
Should I kill them all right here, and ride to Arata on the buggy alone...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, now that I've come this far, it would be easier to have them guide me as far as the settlement entrance.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had planned to walk all along, but if they'll take me there by buggy, there's no reason not to make use of it.<PG>
Even so, my plan keeps changing, one thing after another.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had meant to meet no one until I reached the Arata settlement, but I've already gotten to know four people.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And they all seem like good people.<PG>
My <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="ふくしゅう">vengeful</STYLE> heart gave a sharp throb.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The tumor called conscience kept growing, <STYLE ID="10" RUBY="むしば">eating</STYLE> away at me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Before it's too late, I have to remove this <STYLE ID="11" RUBY="りょうしん">tumor</STYLE>, and fast.<PG>
But removing a tumor on my own is impossible.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So, as I decided, I will do what must be done before the tumor gets worse.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I slipped my hand quietly into my bag and checked the feel of the gun.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\キオク\拳銃.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
A capacity of 12 rounds, a weight of 730 grams.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
143 rounds of 9mm Parabellum.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had test-fired just one round, so the count was an awkward 12 dozen<STYLE ID="12" RUBY="マイナス"> - </STYLE>1.<PG>
If I take this out now, I can kill these three in 10 seconds.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So, what will you do? Keep finding some reason or other to put it off?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Or stop thinking and carry it out at once?<PG>
{MESOFF "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\トラック.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "0" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\ベンチ殴る.ogg" "VOICE2" "NORMAL" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "0" "PASS"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE2" "1000" "0" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "3000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "VOICE2" "500" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\バギーアイドリング.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\キオク\荒田駅バギー.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
With a roar, a blast of hot wind suddenly struck me in the face.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\城崎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Ah, sorry, <STYLE ID="6">Fujino-san</STYLE>."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It seemed exhaust from the buggy's muffler had blown right into my face.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="1">Sakura-san</STYLE> had already left.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Sorry. Thank you for doing this."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I drew my hand out of the bag and climbed on behind Shirozaki-san.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It isn't my conscience I'm following. It's a question of efficiency.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's more efficient, so I won't kill anyone here, and I'll go on to the settlement with them all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's nothing like conscience...!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\バギー運転中.ogg" "SE2" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHGVOL "SE2" "800" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田山道昼ブラー.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―There was no conversation between Shirozaki-san and me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But the whole way, I kept thinking.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What would happen if I shot Shirozaki-san from behind right now?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Would there be an accident?<PG>
No, I don't need to do that. I can just say, "Could you stop for a moment?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I shoot Shirozaki-san dead the moment we stop, it's safe.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then what happens once I've shot Shirozaki-san dead?<PG>
When we never arrive, <STYLE ID="1">Sakura-san</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE> will probably come back looking for us.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And if I kill the two of them then, too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I quietly reached into my bag and checked the feel of the gun once more.<PG>
"<STYLE ID="6">Fujino-san</STYLE>!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Y-yes!" </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Without thinking, I pulled my hand back out of the bag.<PG>
"You really came here at a good time! Until a little while ago, outsiders weren't allowed in!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I know that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The Arata settlement is state-owned land to begin with, and on top of that, insular and closed to outsiders by temperament.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
An ordinary person like me who visits gets turned away, or else arrested for trespassing.<PG>
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Whew..." </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All right. No change to the plan.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'll make him stop the buggy here and shoot Shirozaki-san dead.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then I'll ambush <STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE> or <STYLE ID="1">Sakura-san</STYLE> right here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Sakura-san's</STYLE> precognition is a threat, so I have to kill her as soon as I can.<PG>
Come on, do it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Do it!<PG>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\銃を構える.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
I whipped the gun out of my bag and pointed it at the back of Shirozaki-san's head.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"S-stop!" </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I hated how my voice and my hands were shaking.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Now there's no going back.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\バギーアイドリング.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "1000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田山道昼.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―Suddenly, the buggy stopped.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Good, just like this...!<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE2" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
"<STYLE ID="6">Fujino-san</STYLE>! Hide! Quick!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Huh?" </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Shirozaki-san stood up right where he was and started to turn toward me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
On reflex, I shoved the gun I'd been aiming into my bag, both hands and all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Shirozaki-san didn't seem to have noticed the handgun.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\城崎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"There's a bear up ahead. 
{PAUSE ""}
A hungry one, just out of hibernation! Quick, over here!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Shirozaki-san grabbed something as he got off the buggy and hid among the nearby trees.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Hearing of this unexpected threat, a bear, I followed after Shirozaki-san too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Come on...! One unexpected thing after another...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As if something invisible were getting in my way, my plan was starting to go wrong.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\キオク\草むら.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Then Shirozaki-san readied something.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This is... 
{PAUSE ""}
a hunting rifle?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Had he kept it on the buggy? He peered fixedly through the rifle's scope and pointed the muzzle somewhere.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I couldn't tell where the bear was.<PG>
"<STYLE ID="6">Fujino-san</STYLE>, cover your ears."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At that, I pressed the hands I'd shoved into my bag over my ears.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Shirozaki-san checked that I had, and then―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE追加\ライフル.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "14" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
A gunshot so loud that even with my ears covered, I thought my eardrums might burst.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A fierce smell of gunpowder hanging all around.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Smoke got in my eyes, and I squinted.<PG>
